@startuml
' State machine track wajah — docs/proposal/06-proses-bisnis-dan-alur.md §6.5
[*] --> collecting : track baru / reset
collecting --> collecting : awaiting_consensus / sampling_skipped
collecting --> retry_frontal : ambigu / margin kecil /\nsingle-identity / quality gagal
collecting --> rejected : top1_below_threshold / spoof
retry_frontal --> collecting : frontal look diulang
rejected --> [*]
collecting --> accepted : N frame sepakat + threshold lolos
accepted --> [*] : kirim event matched

note right of retry_frontal
  Status NEED_FRONTAL_RETRY = arahan frontal look,
  tidak pernah auto-accept. Hanya state accepted
  yang boleh mengirim event matched.
end note
@enduml
